OL,3,AMan charged over multiple sex assaults
OL,4,Aat university
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 29-year-old man has been charged with
OL,7,Fsexually assaulting seven women in and
OL,8,Faround the University of Huddersfield.
OL,10,FWest Yorkshire Police said officers
OL,11,Fwere called to the university on
OL,12,FTuesday evening following reports of a
OL,13,Fman approaching and sexually touching
OL,14,Fwomen.
OL,16,FThe force said, following an
OL,17,Finvestigation, Sophan Akbash, from
OL,18,FHuddersfield, had been charged with
OL,19,Fnine counts of sexual assault and is
OL,20,Fdue to appear at Leeds Magistrates'
OL,21,FCourt later.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
