OL,3,AMan charged over multiple sex assaults
OL,4,Aat university
OL,5,
OL,6,FProf Tim Thornton, the university's
OL,7,Fdeputy vice-chancellor, said the
OL,8,Funiversity was working closely with
OL,9,Fpolice and that "the safety and
OL,10,Fwellbeing of our students, staff and
OL,11,Fvisitors is our highest priority".
